     1	---
     2	name: dashboard-reference-curator
     3	description: Selects Dribbble design references for the Almanac Noir dashboard/configurator design project, grounded in the project build context AND the deep design knowledge of the impeccable / design-taste-frontend / ui-ux-pro-max / frontend-design skills. Drives the visible Chrome browser via the claude-in-chrome tools so the search and selection are watchable in a full window. Use when curating design references for the powerline statusline configurator or operator dashboard.
