dashboard-design/output/configurator-elevation/logs/refs.out:77:{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01JLXdyviGfimjEPwEb2sM97","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've hit a wall I can't get past autonomously, and the fix needs your call.\n\n**What happened:**\n- `dribbble_status` → `Session LIVE (logged in)` (probed twice, consistent).\n- `dribbble_search` → returned **only the explore-page nav chrome** (`Explore`, `following`, `recent`, `product-design`, `web-design`, `animation`) and **zero actual shots** — across all 3 required queries plus a retry (4 calls total).\n- This is *not* the documented human-check signal (which returns a single \"run dribbble_auth\" item) and *not* a logged-out state — it looks like a soft check/intercept on the search results endpoint while the cookie still reads as live.\n- The documented remedy is `dribbble_auth` (opens a visible Chrome for you to clear the check), but it's **denied in don't-ask mode**, so I can't run it.\n\nI won't fabricate shot titles/URLs to fill the schema, so here is the strict JSON reflecting the actual empirical state:\n\n```json\n{\"error\":\"search_returned_no_shots\",\"status\":\"Session LIVE (logged in)\",\"detail\":\"dribbble_search returned only explore-page nav links and zero shots across the 3 queries (dark dashboard settings panel / developer tool configuration UI / terminal window UI dark) plus a retry. Not the documented human-check item and not logged-out. Likely a check/intercept on the search endpoint. Remedy is dribbble_auth, denied in don't-ask mode.\",\"searches\":[{\"query\":\"dark dashboard settings panel\",\"shots\":[]},{\"query\":\"developer tool configuration UI\",\"shots\":[]},{\"query\":\"terminal window UI dark\",\"shots\":[]}],\"top\":[]}\n```\n\n**To proceed, pick one:**\n1. Approve `dribbble_auth` (or temporarily switch off don't-ask mode) so I can re-establish the session and clear the check — then I'll re-run the 3 searches and complete the deliverable.\n2. Run `dribbble_auth` yourself / clear the check in the Chrome window, then tell me to retry.\n\nOnce search returns real shots, I'll finish Steps 2-4 and output the full strict JSON."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1662,"cache_read_input_tokens":96040,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1662},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"25cd9258-4626-476a-86e0-63d7afc43f85","uuid":"e726d30d-c9ac-4c3e-a79b-3f397ab37ede","request_id":"req_011Cc9GQTusuRUZAoTwthCSd"}
